'''Chinggis Warriors''' is a [[:Category:Mongolia|Mongolian]] esports organization founded in October 2023.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
* November 27th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with a roster consisting of [[Zilkenberg]], [[me1o]], [[sonq]], [[Greatsage]], and [[baby]]. <ref name="+me1o">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C0J_PpCyE8B/|title=me1o|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2023-11-27}}</ref><ref name="+sonq">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C0J_X9DS6vH/|title=sonq|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2023-11-27}}</ref><ref name="+Zilkenberg">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C0J_nFLS2b_/|title=Zilkenberg|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2023-11-27}}</ref><ref name="+Greatsage">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C0J_jLvSj7F/|title=Greatsage|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2023-11-27}}</ref><ref name="+baby">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C0J_eMHyxSV/|title=Babytronic|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2023-11-27}}</ref>

|content2=
* April 8th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' replace [[me1o]], [[sonq]], [[sKINEE]], and [[6a6ytronic]] with [[xerolte]], [[NEUZ]], [[fury5k]], and [[sT0P]], the latter joining on trial. Additionally, [[Stormrage]] joins as coach. <ref name="cw 2024">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=122137126784121488|date=2024-04-08|language={{flag|mn}} Mongolian|title=Meet our Warriors!|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' part ways with [[starDUST]]. <ref name="-stardust">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C-hD5yYpmVx/|date=2024-08-11|title=Thank you STARDUST|language={{flag|mn}} Mongolian|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' sign [[sergelen19k]]. <ref name=+sergelen19k">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C-wkiBUpFJ5/|date=2024-08-17|title=Бид 5 дахь дайчнаараа sergelen19k -г багтаа авч байна|trans_title=We have sergelen19k on our team as our 5th warrior|language={{flag|mn}} Mongolian|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''}}</ref>
* September 29th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' part ways with [[Zilkenberg]]. <ref name=-zilkenberg">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/chinggiswarriorsesports/posts/pfbid0XDw4R5CC7vb9aw6JNCtJBaEwgDVLivZgBPJkewKNNA1G9KhGCzoQMmKeSKLxeGuSl|date=2024-09-29|title=After a year of incredible teamwork and unforgettable moments, Zilkenberg is moving on to new adventures|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''}}</ref>
* October 6th - [[xerolte]] is acquired by [[The Huns Esports]]. <ref name="-xerolte">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* October 15th - [[fury5k]] is acquired by [[Eruption]]. <ref name="eruption back">{{inside source|source=BestronG}}</ref>
* October 24th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' acquire [[ariucle]] from [[IHC Esports]]. <ref name="+ariucle">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ihc_esports/status/1849351501308891430|title=Hey Ariucle, Just wanted to say a big thank you for bringing IHC back on the CS map!|date=2024-10-24|author=[[IHC Esports]]}}</ref>
* November 20th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' acquire [[ROUX]] and [[efire]] from [[IHC Esports]]. <ref name="+ROUX +efire">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=122179000370121488|title=Goodluck to our new CS roster|date=2024-11-20|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* April 7th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' part ways with [[NEUZ]] and acquire [[cool4st]] on loan from [[IHC Esports]]. <ref name="-NEUZ">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/chinggiswarriorsesports/posts/pfbid021ro21dPYox5EhEBEvzsg8nZukU9omumrLjKg36HHDGWPD6ar3azpsY7JDVCECqxtl|title=Thank you NEUZ|date=2025-04-07|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''}}</ref><ref name="cool4st loan">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/100046989222551/posts/1202749021301394/|title=We’re loaning Cool4st to Chinggis Warriors for the MRQ and ACL tournaments|date=2025-04-08|author=[[IHC Esports]]}}</ref>
* June 23rd - [[cool4st]] returns to [[IHC Esports]] following the end of his loan. <ref name="cool4st returns">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* June 25th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' part ways with [[carnage]]. <ref name="-carnage">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/chinggiswarrior/status/1937890431703916740|title=Thank you, Coach Carnage, for your dedication, leadership, and belief in us|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-06-25}}</ref>
* June 26th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' sign [[bkzxcurs3d]] and [[Redka]], the latter as a coach. <ref name="+redka">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo?fbid=122211418778121488|title=Welcome Redka!|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-06-26}}</ref><ref name="+bkzxcurs3d">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo?fbid=122211419036121488|title=Welcome bkzcurs3d!|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-06-26}}</ref>
* August 20th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' bench [[efire]], part ways with [[bkzxcurs3d]], and acquire [[yAmi]] [[cool4st]] from [[IHC Esports]] as their replacements. <ref name="-bkzxcurs3d efire bench">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=122219903798121488|title=Roster change|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-08-20}}</ref><ref name="+yAmi +cool4st">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=122219969036121488|title=Эргэн бидэнтэй нэгдэж байгаа Содоо болон хамтдаа цаашид тоглохоор болсон Yami-даа амжилт хүсье|trans_title=Good luck to Sodoo, who is joining us again, and Yami, who has decided to playing with us from now|language={{flag|mn}} Mongolian|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-08-20}}</ref>
* October 1st - '''Chinggis Warriors''' bench [[controlez]] and reinstate [[efire]] to the active roster. <ref name="-controlez +efire">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=122226414656121488|title=Roster update|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-10-01}}</ref>
* October 23rd - '''Chinggis Warriors''' bench [[ariucle]] and acquire [[tikuak]] from [[The MongolZ Academy]] as his replacement. <ref name="-ariucle +tikuak">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=122229698480121488|title=Team update|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-10-23}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 6th - [[controlez]] is acquired by [[The Huns Esports]]. <ref name="-controlez">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2008478781850480875|title=Welcome, controlez|date=2025-01-06|author=[[The Huns Esports]]}}</ref>
* July 12th - [[tikuak]] is acquired by [[The MongolZ]]. <ref name="-Tikuak">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo?fbid=122261450864121488|title=Tikuak-даа цаашдын ирээдүйд нь амжилт хүсье|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|trans_title=Wishing Tikuak the best of luck in his future endeavors|date=2026-07-12|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''}}</ref>
* September 27th - '''Chinggis Warriors''' acquire [[tikuak]] from [[The MongolZ]]. <ref name="+tikuak">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2104149067953733717|title=tikuak joins the Chinggis Warriors as of today|date=2026-09-27|author=[[The MongolZ]]}}</ref>
}}

