'''EYEBALLERS''' is a [[:category:Sweden|Swedish]] esports organization founded in 2022 in Avesta, Sweden. Originally a ''[[Counter-Strike]]'' and ''[[Counter-Strike: Source]]'' team, the [[Eyeballers (Counter-Strike team)|Eyeballers]] trademark was acquired by [[JW]] and [[flusha]], reviving the brand after 14 years of inactivity. <ref name="2K22"/>

